      "value": "https://vrchat.canny.io/bug-reports/p/970-on-avatar-loadreload-old-menu-will-snap-to-the-floor\nMy hope is that nothing is being done because they are focused on the bigger UI update and well this is not a breaking bug, just one hell of an annoyance.",
