  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Build 994\nIf your avatar reloads while you have the menu open, the menu tends to move down, leading to inaccessible UI. This effect happens on avatars of all heights, but it is more pronounced the further away you are from average height. I've only tested this in Desktop.\nSteps to reproduce:\nSwitch into a smaller or larger than average avatar\nOpen the \"Safety\" menu\nOpen \"Performance Options\"\nClick \"OK\" or just close out of the menu with the X button in the top right",
